Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.60,0:00:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:05.10,0:00:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:07.40,0:00:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:10.00,0:00:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:17.20,0:00:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:24.97,0:00:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,Banner;20;0;20,{\fs18\an8}本字幕由漫游字幕组制作。翻译：Chris 校对：大神 其他杂项：狒狒。勿将此用于商业，有爱支持正版。
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:24.00,0:00:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加上加藤老師捐的兩萬元
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:26.50,0:00:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,捐款總數達到了十萬元
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:34.00,0:00:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,捐款交給班長橋本真由美保管
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:42.00,0:00:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 我會負責保管好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:57.00,0:00:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有 沒有 沒有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.60,0:01:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼會 我明明好好放在包裏的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:08.70,0:01:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼辦啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:10.30,0:01:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了啊 橋本同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:13.00,0:01:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑 黑田同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:20.50,0:01:25.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}來自黃昏的彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.30,0:01:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起來很不錯啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:33.10,0:01:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 可是十萬啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:35.90,0:01:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說什麼啊 是募捐啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:38.90,0:01:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎麼都是全班…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.60,0:01:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:45.10,0:01:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:46.70,0:01:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼事也沒發生募捐的錢也順利送到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:50.00,0:01:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是託誰的福 你應該清楚吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:56.00,0:01:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 錢呢 帶來了麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:59.00,0:01:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,給
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:02.30,0:02:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這下借你的全還清了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:05.10,0:02:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說什麼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前還的只是利息哦 利息
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:08.60,0:02:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼能
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:09.40,0:02:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什麼怨言麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:11.00,0:02:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果沒有我借給你的話會怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:15.30,0:02:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果討厭的話就告訴大家好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:18.30,0:02:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說我保管的錢弄丟了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:25.00,0:02:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有點口渴了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:27.50,0:02:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去買果汁來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:30.00,0:02:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:32.30,0:02:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:40.00,0:02:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你知道地獄通信嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:42.60,0:02:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點在主頁上寫入內容
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:45.50,0:02:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管什麼仇怨恨都能幫你報的那個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.00,0:02:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:49.00,0:02:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一個補習班的朋友的朋友啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:51.00,0:02:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,據說試過呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:53.70,0:02:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個好像非常危險啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:55.30,0:02:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,委託的人自己也會死
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.00,0:03:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還聽說有人突然就消失了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.50,0:03:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,騙人的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:02.60,0:03:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:05.00,0:03:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼不是碳酸的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:07.80,0:03:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 你一直很討厭的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.20,0:03:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我就要喝碳酸的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:13.00,0:03:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,連這都不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.00,0:03:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是個沒用的傢伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:22.00,0:03:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:28.30,0:03:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,4x-2x=2x
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.50,0:03:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因此2x=120
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:36.00,0:03:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後除以2 x就等於60
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:40.00,0:03:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了x的值後 把x代入一開始的式子裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:43.80,0:03:46.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(0,700)}放學後 老地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:44.30,0:03:46.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,y的值也就能算出來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:04.10,0:04:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近家裏常常會丟錢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:08.70,0:04:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然金額很小
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:10.60,0:04:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是家裏沒人時有小偷啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:14.00,0:04:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說最近很多同樣的家也被偷了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:17.50,0:04:19.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總覺得好可怕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:20.20,0:04:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸晚歸的時候就我們兩個女人在家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:23.00,0:04:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然還是報警…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:29.00,0:04:30.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:50.80,0:04:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs24\pos(420,200)\fad(300,0)\frz-8\t(400,1100,1,\frz0)}君之怨恨    願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.40,0:04:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄通信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.50,0:04:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:18.00,0:05:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,委託的人自己也會死
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.50,0:06:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不會吧 橋本同學她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:01.20,0:06:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說晚上在繁華街看到她了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.70,0:06:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你渴不渴啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:07.10,0:06:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,渴了 渴了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.70,0:06:09.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去自動售貨機買吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:10.00,0:06:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還以爲是個正經的學生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.50,0:06:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外表一點都看不出來呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.50,0:06:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好 被聽到了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:21.00,0:06:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,橋本同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:23.30,0:06:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加藤老師叫你去辦公室一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.20,0:06:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我聽到一個奇怪的傳言啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:31.30,0:06:34.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說你夜晚在外面遊蕩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.50,0:06:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過我覺得肯定是毫無根據的傳言
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:37.60,0:06:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是這樣的孩子 我再清楚不過了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:05.60,0:07:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回來了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:07.60,0:07:09.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了啊 你的臉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:10.80,0:07:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:13.00,0:07:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼什麼都不告訴我呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.30,0:07:17.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近你好奇怪啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.00,0:07:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然我不願意這麼想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.00,0:07:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道最近家裏不見的錢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:23.10,0:07:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽是相信你的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:30.70,0:07:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs18}現在是12點，指7的是定鬧錶的指針。
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:35.20,0:07:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs24\pos(420,200)}君之怨恨    願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:14.20,0:08:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已予受理
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:25.70,0:08:26.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:27.00,0:08:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了啊 那隻眼睛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:30.90,0:08:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.00,0:08:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚8點 別忘了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:48.50,0:08:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,從那以後 什麼都沒發生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:52.00,0:08:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,結果 什麼地獄通信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:55.20,0:08:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是個傳言
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:59.80,0:09:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去搭訕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:01.50,0:09:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:02.50,0:09:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目標是能請客喫飯的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:05.40,0:09:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是大叔也沒關係哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:07.30,0:09:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:08.40,0:09:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這都怪你沒本事拿錢來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.40,0:09:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在發什麼呆啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.20,0:09:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個就不錯啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.00,0:09:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多數會上鉤
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:28.20,0:09:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但 但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:31.20,0:09:31.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:36.00,0:09:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:37.80,0:09:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:39.80,0:09:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我 怎麼說呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:42.00,0:09:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道是要拉客人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:44.20,0:09:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可愛啊 你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:45.90,0:09:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多大了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.60,0:09:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,OK OK 你一個人嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:50.00,0:09:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到哪裏去呢 要喫什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:52.90,0:09:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:53.80,0:09:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:58.00,0:09:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.00,0:10:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:03.30,0:10:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼逃走了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:08.60,0:10:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:12.00,0:10:13.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次再忘記錢的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:14.20,0:10:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就把你這張雙人照公開
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:10.70,0:11:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這裏是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:19.90,0:11:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:23.00,0:11:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:36.70,0:11:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:40.20,0:11:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:43.00,0:11:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呼喚我來的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:48.00,0:11:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請幫我消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:00.00,0:12:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請收下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:08.80,0:12:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:13.00,0:12:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將那紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:16.50,0:12:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:18.00,0:12:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和我正式締結了契約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:22.00,0:12:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怨恨的人將立刻墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:27.00,0:12:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:30.50,0:12:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:32.50,0:12:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:34.60,0:12:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自身亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:38.20,0:12:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:40.00,0:12:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:43.00,0:12:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:45.00,0:12:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靈魂將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:49.50,0:12:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,無法前往極樂淨土
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:52.00,0:12:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的靈魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:54.10,0:12:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將飽嘗痛楚與苦難
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:57.00,0:12:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永遠徘徊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:19.40,0:13:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之後的事 就由你自己抉擇了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:41.70,0:13:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:43.80,0:13:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在聽嗎 真由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:53.40,0:13:54.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:00.60,0:14:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:03.00,0:14:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:05.00,0:14:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靈魂將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:21.30,0:14:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,橋本
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:23.00,0:14:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能和你談談麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:27.00,0:14:30.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在剛纔 學校收到了郵件
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:33.20,0:14:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是這樣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:34.80,0:14:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:35.70,0:14:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要辯解了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:37.60,0:14:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,裏面的人的確是你吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:40.00,0:14:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不覺得羞恥嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:42.00,0:14:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作爲中學生竟然做成這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:44.10,0:14:46.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我還很相信你 可惜啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:46.90,0:14:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:47.70,0:14:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總之 希望請你的父母明天來一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:52.30,0:14:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣下去明年的高中保送也會變的很困難吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:27.00,0:15:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:09.31,0:16:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs14\pos(455,240)\frz-6}10點\N\N\N\N到學校\N\N\N知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:13.90,0:16:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙 在幹什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:16.50,0:16:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真磨蹭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.70,0:16:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:35.90,0:16:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美 你在哪裏啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:50.00,0:16:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:54.40,0:16:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在幹什麼啊 你們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:58.70,0:16:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:09.60,0:17:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:11.20,0:17:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼回事啊 這是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:15.00,0:17:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美 難道你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:17.10,0:17:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:21.00,0:17:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住 你在幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:29.80,0:17:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惡 到底怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:37.00,0:17:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:41.50,0:17:43.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躲起來也是沒用的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:50.80,0:17:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接住
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:56.30,0:17:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個我不大喜歡啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:59.10,0:18:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是很好喫嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:02.00,0:18:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我 在做白日夢嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:07.60,0:18:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 撿個球
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:19.50,0:18:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是個沒用的傢伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:22.00,0:18:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得教訓教訓她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:25.40,0:18:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:34.00,0:18:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫名其妙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:37.40,0:18:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:38.90,0:18:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:41.20,0:18:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:45.00,0:18:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知怎麼回事 學校好奇怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:47.00,0:18:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 我知道了 這邊來吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:53.00,0:18:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 老師 去哪裏啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:56.30,0:18:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用擔心 朋友們都在等着你啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:09.00,0:19:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亞矢 救命啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:11.30,0:19:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亞矢 亞矢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:32.00,0:19:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這 這是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:55.00,0:19:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:58.20,0:20:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你偷的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:01.10,0:20:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什 什麼啊 這完全是胡說八道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:03.80,0:20:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什麼證據麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:05.60,0:20:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有誰看到了麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:07.10,0:20:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:17.00,0:20:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼樣 有點銘記於心了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:22.40,0:20:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是誰啊 你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:30.70,0:20:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們是真由美的同夥吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:33.60,0:20:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然做出這麼過分的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:35.60,0:20:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你還說我們做得過分
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:40.00,0:20:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還不承認自己的罪行嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:44.00,0:20:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姑娘 不要這麼倔強哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:49.10,0:20:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:50.80,0:20:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是戲弄了她一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:52.30,0:20:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是鬧着玩的 鬧着玩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:54.00,0:20:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我並沒做什麼壞事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:56.00,0:20:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她這麼說哦 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:01.00,0:21:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失於黑暗中的可悲之影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:04.00,0:21:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傷害鄙視他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:08.00,0:21:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉溺於罪惡的孽魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:11.10,0:21:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:29.10,0:21:30.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這 這裏是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:38.00,0:21:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等這是哪 要帶我去哪…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:47.10,0:21:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:49.30,0:21:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:04.00,0:22:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真由美 加藤老師在叫你啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:07.60,0:22:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說想跟你談談準備運動會的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:10.60,0:22:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我知道啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:13.90,0:22:14.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:16.00,0:22:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精神好多了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:18.60,0:22:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有段時間眼睛都是這樣的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:21.00,0:22:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起啊 讓你擔心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:24.00,0:22:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是這個狀態 實行委員要加油哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:26.80,0:22:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 謝謝 再見
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:38.20,0:22:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死後 靈魂亦將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:56.40,0:23:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:14.50,0:23:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn华文细黑\fad(200,200)\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て　{\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:21.00,0:23:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn华文细黑\fad(200,200)\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て　{\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:27.90,0:23:40.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn华文细黑\fad(200,200)\K40}空{\K140}の{\K40}鳥{\K120}へ　{\K40}哀{\K40}し{\K80}み{\K80}の{\K200}せ　{\K100}飛{\K40}ば{\K80}す{\K200}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:45.00,0:23:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn华文细黑\fad(200,200)\K50}ここ{\K140}は{\K20}仮{\K70}縫{\K50}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:48.80,0:23:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn华文细黑\fad(200,200)\K210}私{\K180}を{\K60\K100}縛{\K60}る{\K30\K140}永{\K200}遠 
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:59.80,0:24:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn华文细黑\fad(200,200)\K80}行{\K20}き{\K100}も{\K30\K100}帰{\K80}り{\K200}も
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:06.80,0:24:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn华文细黑\fad(200,200)\K40}過{\K30}ぎ{\K40}て{\K40\K240}ゆ{\K220}く{\K220}は{\K100}夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:29.44,0:24:31.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:32.90,0:24:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:35.00,0:24:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鷹村涼子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:36.80,0:24:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在被追趕嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:38.60,0:24:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被監視着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:40.50,0:24:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙一直盯着我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:44.00,0:24:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好難受
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:45.70,0:24:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再也不能忍受了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:47.60,0:24:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,願望是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:49.10,0:24:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將他流放到地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:52.90,0:24:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:56.50,0:25:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\c&H0000FF&}下集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:56.50,0:25:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}着魔的少女
